 Shop</h1>   <p class="byline"> Over The Moon · 2026 · Casual / Simulation </p> <a class="ai-overview" href="#ai" aria-label="View AI-use evidence for Tidy Up the Flower Shop: 5 of 8 areas"> <div class="ai-overview-head"> <span class="ai-overview-title"><span class="ai-overview-logo" aria-hidden="true">▶</span> AI USE <span class="muted">Developer disclosure scope</span></span> <span class="ai-overview-count"><strong>5</strong><span>/ 8</span></span> </div> <div class="ai-overview-grid"> <span class="ai-overview-tile" title="In-game generation：Not stated"> <span class="ai-overview-symbol" aria-hidden="true">▣</span> <span class="ai-overview-name">In-game generation</span> </span><span class="ai-overview-tile" title="Code：Not stated"> <span class="ai-overview-symbol" aria-hidden="true">⌘</span> <span class="ai-overview-name">Code</span> </span><span class="ai-overview-tile is-used" title="Art：AI use disclosed"> <span class="ai-overview-symbol" aria-hidden="true">◈</span> <span class="ai-overview-name">Art</span> </span><span class="ai-overview-tile is-used" title="Music &#38; sound：AI use disclosed"> <span class="ai-overview-symbol" aria-hidden="true">♫</span> <span class="ai-overview-name">Music &amp; sound</span> </span><span class="ai-overview-tile is-used" title="Voice：AI use disclosed"> <span class="ai-overview-symbol" aria-hidden="true">◉</span> <span class="ai-overview-name">Voice</span> </span><span class="ai-overview-tile" title="Writing：Not stated"> <span class="ai-overview-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✎</span> <span class="ai-overview-name">Writing</span> </span><span class="ai-overview-tile is-used" title="Translation：AI use disclosed"> <span class="ai-overview-symbol" aria-hidden="true">文</span> <span class="ai-overview-name">Translation</span> </span><span class="ai-overview-tile is-used" title="Marketing：AI use disclosed"> <span class="ai-overview-symbol" aria-hidden="true">↗</span> <span class="ai-overview-name">Marketing</span> </span> </div> <div class="ai-overview-foot"><span><i class="ai-key used"></i>Reported use</span><span><i class="ai-key"></i>Unmarked does not mean AI-free</span><span class="ai-overview-arrow">View evidence ↗</span></div> </a> <div class="ai-chips"> <span class="chip used">Art</span><span class="chip used">Music &amp; sound</span><span class="chip used">Voice</span><span class="chip used">Translation</span><span class="chip used">Marketing</span>  </div> <div class="actions"> <a class="btn primary" href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/5221510/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Steam store ↗</a> <button class="btn" id="saveBtn" type="button" title="Saved in this browser only">☆ Save</button> <button class="btn" id="shareBtn" type="button">Share</button> </div> <dl class="facts"> <div><dt>Steam App ID</dt><dd><code>5221510</code><button class="copy" id="copyId" type="button">Copy</button></dd></div> <div><dt>Developer</dt><dd>Over The Moon</dd></div> <div><dt>Publisher</dt><dd>Over The Moon</dd></div> <div><dt>Release date</dt><dd>Oct 2, 2026</dd></div> <div><dt>Price</dt><dd>¥ 26.00</dd></div> <div><dt>Platforms</dt><dd>Windows</dd></div> <div><dt>Genres</dt><dd>Casual / Simulation</dd></div> <div><dt>Tags</dt><dd>单人、Steam 成就、完全支持控制器、自定义音量控制、#category_playable_at_your_own_pace、无需应对快速反应事件、DualSense 控制器支持、DualSense 控制器支持、立体声、家庭共享</dd></div>   <div><dt>Languages</dt><dd class="clamp">英语 * , 法语, 意大利语, 德语, 西班牙语 - 西班牙, 阿拉伯语, 保加利亚语, 捷克语, 丹麦语, 荷兰语, 芬兰语, 希腊语, 匈牙利语, 印度尼西亚语, 日语, 韩语, 马来语, 挪威语, 波兰语, 葡萄牙语 - 巴西, 葡萄牙语 - 葡萄牙, 罗马尼亚语, 俄语, 简体中文, 西班牙语 - 拉丁美洲, 瑞典语, 泰语, 繁体中文, 土耳其语, 乌克兰语, 越南语 * 具有完全音频支持的语言</dd></div>   </dl> </aside> </section> <nav class="section-nav" aria-label="On this page"> <a href="#ai">AI use</a> <a href="#evidence">Evidence</a> <a href="#steam">Steam data</a> <a href="#developer">Developer</a> <a href="#sources">Sources &amp; corrections</a> </nav> <section class="section" id="ai"> <div class="section-head"> <div><div class="eyebrow">AI USE</div><h2>Eight areas, separate answers</h2></div> <div class="section-meta">5 / 8 areas with reported AI use</div> </div> <div class="status-note tone-amber"> <strong>Official AI disclosure</strong><span>The developer has disclosed generative AI use. The original source defines its scope.</span> </div> <p class="section-lede">A cozy first-person tidying game released on Oct 2, 2026, developed and published by Over The Moon and filed under Casual and Simulation, where a scattered flower delivery has to be sorted into baskets before the shop opens. The Steam AI disclosure says generative AI is used across all disciplines of game development, most often with heavy amounts of human editing, and names audio, visual art, the logo and localisation. This site records art, music, voice, translation and marketing as used on that wording, with music and voice mapped from the single word audio and marketing from the logo item, and code, writing and live in-game generation as areas the disclosure does not address. The same studio publishes its wording almost identically on its earlier title, and both remain self-statements that have not been independently audited.</p>  <div class="table-wrap"> <table class="ai-table"> <thead> <tr><th>Area</th><th>Scope</th><th>Status</th><th>Notes</th></tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td><strong>In-game generation</strong><small>In-game AI</small></td> <td class="muted">Content generated during play</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">This area is not addressed by the reviewed disclosure; that is not proof of non-use. The disclosure never says whether anything is generated while the player plays.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Code</strong><small>Code</small></td> <td class="muted">Programming and development</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">This area is not addressed by the reviewed disclosure; that is not proof of non-use. The all disciplines phrase is broad but code is never named, so this site does not infer it.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Art</strong><small>Art</small><a href="#evidence" class="area-provenance">View source ↗</a></td> <td class="muted">Visual assets</td> <td><span class="state s-used">AI use disclosed</span></td> <td class="muted">The developer states generative AI is used across all disciplines of game development with heavy amounts of human editing and names visual art among them, so art is recorded as used with that editing claim attached.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Music &amp; sound</strong><small>Music &amp; SFX</small><a href="#evidence" class="area-provenance">View source ↗</a></td> <td class="muted">Music and sound</td> <td><span class="state s-used">AI use disclosed</span></td> <td class="muted">The enumerating sentence uses the single word audio and does not name music separately; this area is recorded as used through that word, on the developer statement.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Voice</strong><small>Voice</small><a href="#evidence" class="area-provenance">View source ↗</a></td> <td class="muted">Voice and dialogue audio</td> <td><span class="state s-used">AI use disclosed</span></td> <td class="muted">The same word audio is also mapped onto voice, which the disclosure does not list on its own; the mapping is recorded here rather than presented as the developer wording.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Writing</strong><small>Writing</small></td> <td class="muted">Story and written content</td> <td><span class="state s-not_stated">Not stated</span></td> <td class="muted">This area is not addressed by the reviewed disclosure; that is not proof of non-use. The disclosure lists audio, visual art, the logo and localisation but never mentions written content.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Translation</strong><small>Translation</small><a href="#evidence" class="area-provenance">View source ↗</a></td> <td class="muted">Translation and localization</td> <td><span class="state s-used">AI use disclosed</span></td> <td class="muted">The enumerating sentence names localisation as one of the areas where generative AI is used.</td> </tr><tr> <td><strong>Marketing</strong><small>Marketing</small><a href="#evidence" class="area-provenance">View source ↗</a></td> <td class="muted">Promotional material</td> <td><span class="state s-used">AI use disclosed</span></td> <td class="muted">The enumerating sentence names the logo, which is store and promotional material, so marketing is recorded as used; the disclosure does not say whether other promotional images are in the same scope.</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> <div class="legend"> <span><i class="dot used"></i>Reported use (official / third-party)</span> <span><i class="dot not_stated"></i>Not stated (not proof of no use)</span> <span><i class="dot claimed_none"></i>Developer claims no AI</span> <span><i class="dot unreviewed"></i>Unreviewed</span> </div> <blockquote class="quote"> <p>“We use generative AI across all disciplines of game development most often with heavy amounts of human editing. That involves audio and visual art, our logo, and localization. We use it as a productivity tool so we can achieve a higher level of quality, faster, than we would have been able to.”</p> <footer>Steam 商店 AI 生成内容披露栏完整原文，2026-11-05 核查；可能随商店页更新。 · <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/5221510/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read original ↗</a></footer> </blockquote> <details class="callout"> <summary><strong>How to interpret these statuses</strong></summary> <p>Reported AI use: 5/8. Developer no-use claims: 0/8. Claims are not independent verification; not stated does not mean no AI use.</p> </details> <p class="source-line"> Primary source:<a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/5221510/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Official disclosure ↗</a> <span> · Reviewed 2026-11-05</span> </p> </section> <section class="section" id="evidence"> <div class="section-head"> <div><div class="eyebrow">EVIDENCE</div><h2>Evidence</h2></div> <div class="section-meta">4 sources</div> </div> <div class="timeline"> <article class="evidence-card"> <div class="evidence-top"> <span class="evidence-type">Official disclosure</span> <time>2026-11-05</time> </div> <h3>Steam 商店完整 AI 披露</h3> <p>We use generative AI across all disciplines of game development most often with heavy amounts of human editing. That involves audio and visual art, our logo, and localization. We use it as a productivity tool so we can achieve a higher level of quality, faster, than we would have been able to.</p> <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/5221510/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Original source ↗</a> </article><article class="evidence-card"> <div class="evidence-top"> <span class="evidence-type">Steam discussion index</span> <time>2026-11-05</time> </div> <h3>Steam 讨论区首页核查</h3> <p>英文讨论区首页显示 15 个主题（总数 37）；仅覆盖首页。</p> <a href="https://steamcommunity.com/app/5221510/discussions/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Original source ↗</a> </article><article class="evidence-card"> <div class="evidence-top"> <span class="evidence-type">Community report</span> <time>2026-11-05</time> </div> <h3>ai usage</h3> <p>does anyone know if this game uses ai? a lot of these tidy up games use them :/ Llamawolfe View Profile View Posts Oct 15 @ 7:22am Report this post This information is listed on the store page. Most games now do use AI in one way or another. It&#39;s not as simple as &quot;hey AI, make this game for me.&quot; #1 Caffeinated_Writer View Profile View Posts Oct 15 @ 9:11pm Report this post AI Generated Content Disclosure The developers describe how their game uses AI Generated Content like this: We use generative AI across all disciplines of game development most often with heavy amounts of human editing. That involves audio and visual art, our logo, and localization. We use it as a productivity tool so we can achieve a higher level of quality, faster, than we would have been able to. #2 poke_k View Profile View Posts Oct 26 @ 7:25am Report this post Originally posted by Llamawolfe : This information is listed on the store page. Most games now do use AI in one way or another. It&#39;s not as simple as &quot;hey AI, make this game for me.&quot; Plenty of game devs do not use AI, and even if most did, it doesn&#39;t change the fact that plenty of people want to avoid it. Using it for art means relying on art theft. #3 Chabibi View Profile View Posts Oct 30 @ 12:34pm Report this post Originally posted by poke_k : Plenty of game devs do not use AI, and even if most did, it doesn&#39;t change the fact that plenty of people want to avoid it. Using it for art means relying on art theft. My sentiments exactly. Only here by chance, was kind of curious as to how many other of these kind of games the publisher had pushed out (and there was one other, think it had some cat on the image). Also found out that I&#39;d played another game by the devs (The Fall), and had its sequel on my wishlist. Now kinda glad I happened to click, saved me from giving money to devs who&#39;d rather pump out clearly AI stuff, over spending time honing something unique. Unwishlisted the sequel. #4</p> <a href="https://steamcommunity.com/app/5221510/discussions/0/570426104667439451/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Original source ↗</a> </article><article class="evidence-card"> <div class="evidence-top"> <span class="evidence-type">Third-party source</span> <time>2026-11-05</time> </div> <h3>GameSpew 本作评测：独立第三方报道，全文未提及 AI</h3> <p>This review of Tidy Up the Flower Shop is based on the PS5 version of the game, with a code provided by the publisher.</p> <a href="https://www.gamespew.com/2026/10/tidy-up-the-flower-shop-review/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Original source ↗</a> </article> </div> <details class="callout"><summary><strong>Review notes (expand)</strong></summary><p>Checked the complete English Steam AI disclosure block, the identity (Over The Moon as both developer and publisher, a full release rather than a demo) and the English discussion homepage, which lists 15 visible topics out of 37 and covers only that first page. The homepage topic matching the keyword, ai usage, was read in full with all 3 visible replies: the original poster asks whether this game uses AI, one reply points out that the information is on the store page and that most games use AI in some way, another pastes the store disclosure verbatim, and a third argues that using AI for art means relying on art theft. No developer post appears in that thread and no poster identity is bound to an official account, so it is treated entirely as player testimony and changes no area finding. This title was searched three times, with the raw responses archived as press-search.json, press-search.b.json and press-search.c.json; the registered disposition covers the 6 results of one response and the other two searches are described in coverageLimits. One source was registered and read in full, the gamespew.com review by Kim Snaith dated Oct 29, 2026, whose 508-word text never mentions generative AI and is used only to confirm the release and review status, with the reviewer noting the PS5 code came from the publisher. The howmuchai.games developer page and the gameaicheck.com new releases list from the other searches were also fetched and read but are statistics and list summaries rather than transcriptions of this disclosure, so they are not registered, and the gamespress.com item is a press release the publisher submitted itself, which also says nothing about AI. No third-party report therefore adds anything beyond the disclosure itself.</p></details> </section> <section class="section" id="steam"> <div class="section-head"> <div><div class="eyebrow">STEAM DATA</div><h2>Steam data</h2></div> <div class="section-meta">Public data snapshot</div> </div> <div class="stat-grid"> <div class="stat"> <span>Online now</span> <strong>38</strong> <small>Steam public API</small> </div> <div class="stat"> <span>Steam reviews</span> <strong>—</strong> <small>No data</small> </div> <div class="stat"> <span>Positive reviews</span> <strong>—</strong> <small>All languages</small> </div> <div class="stat"> <span>Release date</span> <strong>2026</strong> <small>Oct 2, 2026</small> </div> </div> <div class="steam-desc"><h3>Steam description</h3><p>开业就在明天，可是有人好心把整批鲜花全拆开、堆了一地。把花一抱一抱地捡起来，按品种分进花篮，涂上喜欢的花色，赶在天亮前把店里收拾妥当。没有倒计时，没人盯着你看。一款第一人称的治愈系整理游戏。</p></div> <p class="source-line"> Player and review figures are Steam snapshots taken at build time and may be delayed. <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/5221510/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View current data on Steam ↗</a> </p> </section> <section class="section" id="developer"> <div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">DEVELOPER</div><h2>Developer</h2></div></div> <div class="dev-card"> <div class="dev-avatar">OV</div> <div class="dev-body"> <h3>Over The Moon</h3> <p>Developer / publisher</p> <div class="dev-links">  <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/search/?developer=Over%20The%20Moon" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Developer on Steam ↗</a> <a href="https://github.com/COLDDCC/GameAIchecker/issues/new?title=Tidy%20Up%20the%20Flower%20Shop%EF%BC%885221510%EF%BC%89%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%E7%BA%A0%E9%94%99&body=%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%EF%BC%9Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fgameaichecker.com%2Fgames%2F5221510-tidy-up-the-flower-shop%2F%0A%0A%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E7%BA%A0%E6%AD%A3%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%EF%BC%9A%0A%0A%E5%8E%9F%E5%A7%8B%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90%EF%BC%9A%0A%0A%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%9F%EF%BC%9A%0A" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Claim / correct ↗</a> </div> </div> </div>  </section> <section class="section" id="community"> <div class="section-head"> <div><div class="eyebrow">COMMUNITY</div><h2>Player impressions</h2></div> <div class="section-meta">Separate from official disclosures</div> </div> <p class="section-lede">Player impressions are not evidence of AI use. Votes do not change developer disclosure findings.</p> <form id="voteForm" class="vote-form"> <select id="voteSelect" required aria-label="Choose your impression"> <option value="">Your impression…</option> <option value="no_ai_suspected">I suspect no AI use</option> <option value="some_ai_suspected">I suspect some AI use</option> <option value="heavy_ai_suspected">I suspect extensive AI use</option> <option value="all_ai_suspected">I suspect AI throughout</option> </select> <button class="btn primary" type="submit">Submit</button> </form> <p id="voteMessage" class="muted" role="status"></p> <div id="voteCounts" class="vote-counts"></div> <p class="source-line">Feedback availability does not affect the evidence. One vote per network per game.</p> </section> <section class="section" id="sources"> <div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">SOURCES</div><h2>Sources &amp; review limits</h2></div></div> <ul class="source-list"> <li> <span>Official disclosure</span> <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/5221510/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Steam 商店完整 AI 披露</a> <time>2026-11-05</time> </li><li> <span>Steam discussion index</span> <a href="https://steamcommunity.com/app/5221510/discussions/?l=english" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Steam 讨论区首页核查</a> <time>2026-11-05</time> </li><li> <span>Community report</span> <a href="https://steamcommunity.com/app/5221510/discussions/0/570426104667439451/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ai usage</a> <time>2026-11-05</time> </li><li> <span>Third-party source</span> <a href="https://www.gamespew.com/2026/10/tidy-up-the-flower-shop-review/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GameSpew 本作评测：独立第三方报道，全文未提及 AI</a> <time>2026-11-05</time> </li> <li> <span>Steam store</span> <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/5221510/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Tidy Up the Flower Shop · App 5221510</a> <time></time> </li> </ul> <div class="callout"> <strong>Found an error?</strong> <p> Please include an original source, date and specific correction. <a href="https://github.com/COLDDCC/GameAIchecker/issues/new?title=Tidy%20Up%20the%20Flower%20Shop%EF%BC%885221510%EF%BC%89%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%E7%BA%A0%E9%94%99&body=%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%EF%BC%9Ahttps%3A%2F%2Fgameaichecker.com%2Fgames%2F5221510-tidy-up-the-flower-shop%2F%0A%0A%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E7%BA%A0%E6%AD%A3%E7%9A%84%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9%EF%BC%9A%0A%0A%E5%8E%9F%E5%A7%8B%E6%9D%A5%E6%BA%90%EF%BC%9A%0A%0A%E6%97%A5%E6%9C%9F%EF%BC%9A%0A" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Suggest a correction ↗</a> or <a href="https://github.com/COLDDCC/GameAIchecker/issues/new?title=Tidy%20Up%20the%20Flower%20Shop%20%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%E7%BA%A0%E9%94%99" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open a GitHub issue ↗</a>。
</p> </div> </section> <div class="share-bar"> <span>Share this game</span> <button class="btn" id="shareBtn2" type="button">Copy link</button> <a class="btn" href="https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=Does%20Tidy%20Up%20the%20Flower%20Shop%20use%20AI%3F&url=https%3A%2F%2Fgameaichecker.com%2Fgames%2F5221510-tidy-up-the-flower-shop%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Share on X</a> <a class="btn" href="https://www.reddit.com/submit?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgameaichecker.com%2Fgames%2F5221510-tidy-up-the-flower-shop%2F&title=Tidy%20Up%20the%20Flower%20Shop%20%E2%80%94%20AI%20use%20evidence" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Reddit</a> </div> </main> <div class="tf-cta-wrap"><a class="tf-cta" href="https://toolfavor.com/?utm_source=gameaichecker&utm_medium=footer_button" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M12 3l1.9 4.6L18.5 9.5l-4.6 1.9L12 16l-1.9-4.6L5.5 9.5l4.6-1.9z"></path><path d="M19 15l.8 1.9 1.9.8-1.9.8L19 20.4l-.8-1.9-1.9-.8 1.9-.8z"></path></svg><span>Discover more useful tools on ToolFavor</span><svg class="tf-arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg></a></div> <footer class="site-footer"> <div class="wrap"> <span>Game AI Checker · Independent of Valve / Steam.</span> <span>Evidence first · Not stated does not mean unused</span> </div> </footer> <dialog class="lightbox" id="lightbox"> <button id="closeLightbox" type="button" aria-label="Close">×</button> <img id="lightboxImg" alt="" decoding="async" fetchpriority="high"> <div class="lightbox-caption" id="lightboxCaption"></div> </dialog> <script>
    (() => {
      const app = document.getElementById('app');
      const labels = JSON.parse(app?.dataset.ui || '{}');
      const tx = key => labels[key] || key;
      const en = document.documentElement.lang === 'en';
      const key = app?.dataset.gameKey || '';
      const slug = app?.dataset.slug || '';

      document.querySelectorAll('img[data-fallback]').forEach((img) => {
        const fallback = img.dataset.fallback;
        if (!fallback) return;
        img.addEventListener('error', function onError() {
          img.removeEventListener('error', onError);
          img.dataset.fallback = '';
          img.src = fallback;
          img.addEventListener('error', () => { img.style.display = 'none'; }, { once: true });
        });
      });

      const heroImg = document.getElementById('heroImg');
      const heroMedia = document.getElementById('heroMedia');
      const thumbs = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.thumb'));
      const counter = document.getElementById('mediaCount');
      const pauseBtn = document.getElementById('pauseBtn');
      let index = 0;
      let paused = false;
      let hovering = false;
      let timer = null;

      const warmedImages = new Set();
      function warm(full) {
        if (!full || warmedImages.has(full)) return null;
        warmedImages.add(full);
        const image = new Image();
        image.decoding = 'async';
        image.src = full;
        return image;
      }
      // Browse one frame ahead so the lightbox never waits on a cold round trip.
      function warmAround() {
        if (!thumbs.length) return;
        const upcoming = [thumbs[index], thumbs[(index + 1) % thumbs.length]];
        const run = () => upcoming.forEach((thumb) => thumb && warm(thumb.dataset.full));
        if (typeof window.requestIdleCallback === 'function') window.requestIdleCallback(run, { timeout: 1500 });
        else setTimeout(run, 500);
      }

      function show(next) {
        if (!heroImg || !thumbs.length) return;
        index = (next + thumbs.length) % thumbs.length;
        const thumb = thumbs[index];
        heroImg.src = thumb.dataset.src || heroImg.src;
        heroImg.dataset.full = thumb.dataset.full || heroImg.dataset.full;
        thumbs.forEach((item, position) => item.classList.toggle('active', position === index));
        if (counter) counter.textContent = `${index + 1} / ${thumbs.length}`;
        warmAround();
      }

      function schedule() {
        clearInterval(timer);
        if (thumbs.length < 2 || paused || hovering || document.hidden) return;
        timer = setInterval(() => show(index + 1), 6000);
      }

      thumbs.forEach((thumb) => {
        thumb.addEventListener('click', () => {
          show(Number(thumb.dataset.index || 0));
          schedule();
        });
      });

      document.getElementById('prevBtn')?.addEventListener('click', () => { show(index - 1); schedule(); });
      document.getElementById('nextBtn')?.addEventListener('click', () => { show(index + 1); schedule(); });
      pauseBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        paused = !paused;
        pauseBtn.textContent = paused ? '▶' : 'Ⅱ';
        pauseBtn.setAttribute('aria-label', paused ? tx("继续轮播") : tx("暂停轮播"));
        schedule();
      });
      heroMedia?.addEventListener('mouseenter', () => { hovering = true; schedule(); });
      heroMedia?.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => { hovering = false; schedule(); });
      document.addEventListener('visibilitychange', schedule);
      schedule();

      const appId = app?.dataset.appid;
      if (appId && heroImg && !heroImg.getAttribute('src')?.startsWith('/images/steam/')) {
        fetch(`/api/steam-media?id=${encodeURIComponent(appId)}`)
          .then((response) => (response.ok ? response.json() : Promise.reject()))
          .then((data) => {
            if (!data?.available) return;
            for (const shot of data.screenshots || []) {
              const src = shot.thumbnail || shot.full;
              const full = shot.full || shot.thumbnail;
              if (!src || thumbs.some((thumb) => thumb.dataset.full === full)) continue;
              const thumb = document.createElement('button');
              thumb.className = 'thumb';
              thumb.type = 'button';
              thumb.dataset.src = src;
              thumb.dataset.full = full;
              thumb.dataset.index = String(thumbs.length);
              thumb.setAttribute('aria-label', `第 ${thumbs.length + 1} 张图片`);
              const image = document.createElement('img');
              image.src = src;
              image.alt = '';
              image.loading = 'lazy';
              image.decoding = 'async';
              thumb.append(image);
              thumb.addEventListener('click', () => { show(Number(thumb.dataset.index)); schedule(); });
              document.getElementById('thumbs')?.append(thumb);
              thumbs.push(thumb);
            }
            if (counter) counter.textContent = `${index + 1} / ${thumbs.length}`;
            const countText = document.getElementById('mediaCountText');
            if (countText) countText.textContent = `${thumbs.length} ${en ? 'official images' : '张官方图片'}`;
            schedule();

            if (data.movies?.length) {
              const mediaCol = document.querySelector('.media-col');
              let videos = document.querySelector('.videos');
              if (!videos && mediaCol) {
                videos = document.createElement('div');
                videos.className = 'videos';
                videos.innerHTML = '<div class="mini-title"></div><div class="video-grid"></div>';
                videos.querySelector('.mini-title').textContent = tx('宣传视频');
                mediaCol.append(videos);
              }
              const grid = videos?.querySelector('.video-grid');
              if (grid) {
                const first = data.movies.find((movie) => movie.webm || movie.mp4);
                if (first) {
                  const player = document.createElement('video');
                  player.className = 'trailer';
                  player.controls = true;
                  player.preload = 'none';
                  player.poster = first.thumbnail || '';
                  player.src = first.webm || first.mp4;
                  grid.before(player);
                }
                for (const movie of data.movies.slice(0, 4)) {
                  if (!movie.thumbnail) continue;
                  const link = document.createElement('a');
                  link.className = 'video-card';
                  link.href = data.steamUrl || `https://store.steampowered.com/app/${appId}/`;
                  link.target = '_blank';
                  link.rel = 'noopener noreferrer';
                  const poster = document.createElement('img');
                  poster.src = movie.thumbnail;
                  poster.alt = movie.name || tx("宣传视频");
                  poster.loading = 'lazy';
                  const label = document.createElement('span');
                  label.textContent = `${movie.name || tx("观看宣传视频")} ↗`;
                  link.append(poster, label);
                  grid.append(link);
                }
              }
            }
          })
          .catch(() => {});
      }

      const lightbox = document.getElementById('lightbox');
      const lightboxImg = document.getElementById('lightboxImg');
      const lightboxCaption = document.getElementById('lightboxCaption');
      function openLightbox() {
        if (!heroImg || !lightbox || !lightboxImg) return;
        const full = heroImg.dataset.full || heroImg.src;
        // The 1280 hero frame is already decoded, so the dialog shows at once and upgrades in place.
        lightboxImg.src = heroImg.currentSrc || heroImg.src;
        lightboxImg.alt = heroImg.alt || '';
        if (lightboxCaption) lightboxCaption.textContent = heroImg.alt || '';
        if (typeof lightbox.showModal === 'function') lightbox.showModal();
        const larger = warm(full);
        if (larger) larger.onload = () => { lightboxImg.src = larger.src; };
      }
      document.getElementById('openLightbox')?.addEventListener('click', openLightbox);
      heroImg?.addEventListener('click', openLightbox);
      [document.getElementById('openLightbox'), heroMedia].forEach((node) => node?.addEventListener('pointerenter', () => warm(heroImg?.dataset.full), { once: true }));
      document.getElementById('closeLightbox')?.addEventListener('click', () => lightbox?.close());
      lightbox?.addEventListener('click', (event) => { if (event.target === lightbox) lightbox.close(); });

      const saveBtn = document.getElementById('saveBtn');
      const starKey = `gac:star:${slug}`;
      function paintStar() {
        if (!saveBtn) return;
        const active = localStorage.getItem(starKey) === '1';
        saveBtn.textContent = active ? tx("★ 已收藏") : tx("☆ 收藏");
        saveBtn.classList.toggle('active', active);
      }
      saveBtn?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        if (localStorage.getItem(starKey) === '1') localStorage.removeItem(starKey);
        else localStorage.setItem(starKey, '1');
        paintStar();
      });
      paintStar();

      async function copyLink() {
        const url = window.location.href;
        try {
          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(url);
          flash(tx("链接已复制"));
        } catch {
          window.prompt(tx("复制链接"), url);
        }
      }
      function flash(message) {
        const target = document.getElementById('voteMessage') || document.getElementById('shareBtn');
        if (!target) return;
        const original = target.textContent;
        if (target.id === 'voteMessage') {
          target.textContent = message;
          setTimeout(() => { target.textContent = original; }, 2200);
        } else {
          target.textContent = message;
          setTimeout(() => { target.textContent = tx("分享"); }, 2200);
        }
      }
      async function share() {
        if (navigator.share) {
          try {
            await navigator.share({ title: document.title, url: window.location.href });
            return;
          } catch {}
        }
        copyLink();
      }
      document.getElementById('shareBtn')?.addEventListener('click', share);
      document.getElementById('shareBtn2')?.addEventListener('click', copyLink);

      document.getElementById('copyId')?.addEventListener('click', async () => {
        const id = app?.dataset.appid;
        if (!id) return;
        try {
          await navigator.clipboard.writeText(id);
          flash(tx("App ID 已复制"));
        } catch {}
      });

      const voteForm = document.getElementById('voteForm');
      const voteMessage = document.getElementById('voteMessage');
      const voteCounts = document.getElementById('voteCounts');
      const voteSelect = document.getElementById('voteSelect');
      const voteNames = {
        no_ai_suspected: tx("认为没有使用 AI"),
        some_ai_suspected: tx("认为部分使用 AI"),
        heavy_ai_suspected: tx("认为大量使用 AI"),
        all_ai_suspected: tx("认为几乎全程使用 AI"),
      };
      function showCounts(counts) {
        if (!voteCounts) return;
        voteCounts.replaceChildren();
        for (const [code, label] of Object.entries(voteNames)) {
          const value = Number(counts?.[code] || 0);
          if (!value) continue;
          const row = document.createElement('div');
          row.textContent = en ? `${value} players ${label}` : `${value} 位玩家${label}`;
          voteCounts.append(row);
        }
      }
      if (voteForm && key) {
        fetch(`/api/feedback?game=${encodeURIComponent(key)}`)
          .then((response) => (response.ok ? response.json() : Promise.reject()))
          .then((data) => {
            showCounts(data.counts);
            if (voteMessage) voteMessage.textContent = tx("反馈功能已启用。");
          })
          .catch(() => {
            if (voteMessage) voteMessage.textContent = tx("匿名反馈暂未启用，等待管理员配置数据库。");
          });
        voteForm.addEventListener('submit', async (event) => {
          event.preventDefault();
          const vote = voteSelect?.value;
          if (!vote) return;
          const button = voteForm.querySelector('button[type="submit"]');
          if (button) button.disabled = true;
          try {
            const response = await fetch('/api/feedback', {
              method: 'POST',
              headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' },
              body: JSON.stringify({ game: key, vote }),
            });
            const data = await response.json();
            if (!response.ok) {
              if (voteMessage) voteMessage.textContent = response.status === 409 ? tx("该网络已对本游戏投过票。") : tx("提交失败，请稍后再试。");
              if (data.counts) showCounts(data.counts);
            } else {
              if (voteMessage) voteMessage.textContent = tx("反馈已记录，谢谢参与。");
              showCounts(data.counts);
              voteForm.reset();
            }
          } catch {
            if (voteMessage) voteMessage.textContent = tx("网络错误，请稍后重试。");
          } finally {
            if (button) button.disabled = false;
          }
        });
      }

      const navLinks = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.section-nav a'));
      if (navLinks.length && 'IntersectionObserver' in window) {
        const linksById = new Map(navLinks.map((link) => [link.getAttribute('href')?.slice(1), link]));
        const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
          for (const entry of entries) {
            if (!entry.isIntersecting) continue;
            navLinks.forEach((link) => link.classList.remove('active'));
            linksById.get(entry.target.id)?.classList.add('active');
          }
        }, { rootMargin: '-35% 0px -55% 0px' });
        document.querySelectorAll('section[id]').forEach((section) => observer.observe(section));
      }
    })();
  </script> <script>
    document.getElementById('game-language')?.addEventListener('change', (event) => {
      const slug = document.getElementById('app')?.dataset.slug;
      if (slug) window.location.assign('/games/' + (event.target.value === 'en' ? '' : event.target.value + '/') + encodeURIComponent(slug) + '/' + location.hash);
    });
  </script> </body> </html>